{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: LLM基础MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"什么是 CoT/ToT/ReAct？它们的适用场景和局限是什么？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LLM基础与Prompt工程\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/LLM基础\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">LLM基础MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"什么是 CoT/ToT/ReAct？它们的适用场景和局限是什么？\" dir=\"auto\">什么是 CoT/ToT/ReAct？它们的适用场景和局限是什么？</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">CoT、ToT、ReAct 分别是什么？它们的适用场景和局限性分别是什么？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、三种推理范式对比</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CoT</strong></td>\n<td>Chain of Thought</td>\n<td>逐步推理，先思考再回答</td>\n<td>数学计算、逻辑推理</td>\n<td>简单任务增加延迟和 Token</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>ToT</strong></td>\n<td>Tree of Thoughts</td>\n<td>多分支探索，选择最优路径</td>\n<td>创意生成、战略规划</td>\n<td>计算成本高，需要评估函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>ReAct</strong></td>\n<td>Reasoning + Acting</td>\n<td>推理与工具调用交替进行</td>\n<td>Agent 任务、外部信息查询</td>\n<td>工具调用增加延迟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、CoT（思维链）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># Zero-shot CoT</span>\nprompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n问题：一个农场有鸡和兔，头共 35 个，脚共 94 只。鸡兔各几只？\n让我们一步步思考：\n\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 模型会自动输出推理过程</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Few-shot CoT</span>\nprompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\nQ: 2+3×4=?\nA: 先算乘法 3×4=12，再算加法 2+12=14。答案是 14。\n\nQ: (5+3)×2=?\nA: 先算括号 5+3=8，再算乘法 8×2=16。答案是 16。\n\nQ: 一个农场有鸡和兔...\nA:\n\"\"\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三、ReAct（推理+行动）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># ReAct 循环模式</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ReActAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"ReAct = Reasoning + Acting\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> step <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>max_steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># Thought: 思考当前状态和目标</span>\n            thought <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Thought: 基于观察 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>observations<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">，思考下一步\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># Action: 调用工具</span>\n            action <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Action: 基于思考 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">，选择工具\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># Observation: 工具返回结果</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"finish\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">input</span>\n            \n            observation <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">input</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>observations<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"超过最大步数\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># ReAct 典型轨迹:</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Thought: 需要查询当前天气</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Action: call_tool(\"weather_api\", location=\"北京\")</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Observation: {\"temperature\": 25, \"condition\": \"晴\"}</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Thought: 已获取天气信息，可以回答用户</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Action: finish(\"北京今天天气晴，温度 25°C\")</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>四、选择指南</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">select_reasoning_paradigm</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> has_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> has_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"ReAct\"</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 需要工具调用的任务</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"math\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> task <span class=\"token keyword\">or</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"logic\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"CoT\"</span>    <span class=\"token comment\"># 数学/逻辑推理</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"creative\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> task <span class=\"token keyword\">or</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"planning\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"ToT\"</span>    <span class=\"token comment\"># 创意/规划</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"direct\"</span>     <span class=\"token comment\"># 简单任务直接回答</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"CoT 对所有任务都有帮助吗？\"</strong> — 不是！简单任务反而增加 Token 消耗和延迟</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"ReAct 最大步数设多少合适？\"</strong> — 通常 5-10 步，防止无限循环</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">LLM基础MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}